{"id":"3b05ff7db230d81f","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-encoding.md","title":"Coding Function","display":"df-encoding — Coding Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-encoding","aliases":["88-df-encoding"],"display":"df-encoding — Coding Function","depends_on":["[[88-df-injective]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-encoding — Coding Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>背景理论为 ZFC；有限元组、有限词、乘积及素数序列使用通常的集合论编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^k\">\\(\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^k\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i\">\\(p_i\\)</span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 个素数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_1=2\">\\(p_1=2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(t=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 为有限数元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\">\\(c,d\\)</span> 为候选函数图。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\">\\(E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的编码图谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是通过下述唯一函数图引入的<strong>定义性保守扩张函数词汇</strong>，不是任意待选参数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coding},\\mathrm{WordCoding}\">\\(\\mathrm{Coding},\\mathrm{WordCoding}\\)</span> 是本文件定义的规范编码谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Injective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Injective}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"186aad749d027077\" href=\"?note=186aad749d027077\" title=\"88-df-injective\">88-df-injective</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}\\)</span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1^r\">\\(1^r\\)</span> 表示长度为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的全一词，邻接表示词连接。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nz=2^k\\prod_{i=1}^k p_{i+1}^{x_i+1}\\right),\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nw=1^k0\\,1^{x_1}0\\cdots1^{x_k}0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nz=2^k\\prod_{i=1}^k p_{i+1}^{x_i+1}\\right),\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nw=1^k0\\,1^{x_1}0\\cdots1^{x_k}0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists!w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{enc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{wordenc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,w\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\{0,1\\}^*:E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\exists!w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{enc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}:E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{wordenc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,w\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\{0,1\\}^*:E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coding}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nc:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n(c(t)=z\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WordCoding}(d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(d(t)=w\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coding}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nc:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\n(c(t)=z\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WordCoding}(d)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nd:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(d(t)=w\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\\land\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{enc},\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{wordenc},\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}^*).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\\land\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{enc},\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\mathbb N_{&gt;0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{wordenc},\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega},\\{0,1\\}^*).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>空元组的数码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，词码为单个字符 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>。数码的素数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 指数给出元组长度，后续素数指数给出各分量加一；词码首先给出长度，再逐段给出各分量。因此两个图在各自声明的输入类型上都存在且唯一，并且都是单射。合法码的识别与解码均有终止算法；数码并不是满射配对函数。</p>\n<p>这里的函数应用是有类型的缩写。把含编码应用的公式逐项替换为相应图谓词及唯一值量词，即得到原集合论语言的公式；没有增加关于旧词汇的新公理。后续引用本文件即导入这两个固定函数及其定义，不需要再从仅有的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Coding}(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Coding}(c)\\)</span> 名字中猜测是否已经选定编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"186aad749d027077","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-injective]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-injective","status":"resolved","id":"186aad749d027077","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Coding},\\mathrm{WordCoding}$ 是本文件定义的规范编码谓词；$\\mathrm{Injective}$ 见 [[88-df-injective]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"p_i","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"p_1=2","display":false},{"tex":"t=(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"c,d","display":false},{"tex":"E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wordenc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coding},\\mathrm{WordCoding}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Injective}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{enc}(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{wordenc}","display":false},{"tex":"1^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nE_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nz=2^k\\prod_{i=1}^k p_{i+1}^{x_i+1}\\right),\\\\\nE_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\left(t=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle\\land\nw=1^k0\\,1^{x_1}0\\cdots1^{x_k}0\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z),\\\\\n&\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;\\exists!w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{enc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,z\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathbb N_{>0}:E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)\\},\\\\\n&\\mathrm{wordenc}\\coloneqq\\{\\langle t,w\\rangle\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\times\\{0,1\\}^*:E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Coding}(c)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nc:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall z\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\;\n(c(t)=z\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{num}}(t,z)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{WordCoding}(d)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nd:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\land\n\\forall t\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\;\\forall w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;\n(d(t)=w\\leftrightarrow E_{\\mathrm{word}}(t,w)).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})\\land\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{enc},\\mathbb N^{<\\omega},\\mathbb N_{>0})\n\\land\\mathrm{Injective}(\\mathrm{wordenc},\\mathbb N^{<\\omega},\\{0,1\\}^*).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Coding}(c)","display":false}],"bytes":3595,"backlinks":[{"id":"55266516c016ab89","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$ (pairing/tuple code, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"c78101abe1090034","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$ (pairing/tuple code, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"64279ecae5246baf","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{WordCoding}(\\mathrm{wordenc})$ (binary word coding, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"20e88b72affa35d1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 中已唯一确定的定义性编码函数；此处使用其长度为二的元组码。"},{"id":"353b45b92236cdbb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$ (effective pairing/tuple code, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Coding}(\\mathrm{enc})$ (finite-tuple coding, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"5d2dec526682fb65","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{wordenc}(\\vec x)\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ (binary input word, see [[88-df-encoding]])"},{"id":"b80082f9a69a6b62","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{enc}$ 是 [[88-df-encoding]] 的固定定义性编码函数；$\\rho(\\sigma,x,y)$ 是本文件定义的规则数码。对长度为 $\\ell$ 的初段，$\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma)$ 缩写 $\\mathrm{enc}(\\sigma(0),\\ldots,\\sigma(\\ell-1))$，空初段使用空元组码。"},{"id":"b952d88439f7be8f","anchor":"ref-4","l